1
00:00:06,200 --> 00:00:07,860
Concerning hobbits.

2
00:00:09,880 --> 00:00:14,370
Hobbits have been living and farming in
the forefardings of the Shire for many

3
00:00:14,420 --> 00:00:20,610
hundreds of years. Quite content to ignore
and be ignored by the world of the big

4
00:00:20,660 --> 00:00:21,340
folk.

5
00:00:22,440 --> 00:00:28,720
In fact, it has been remarked by some that
hobbits' only real passion is for food.

6
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:35,350
A rather unfair observation, as we have
also developed a keen interest in the

7
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,820
brewing of ales and the
smoking of pipe weed.

8
00:00:39,740 --> 00:00:46,050
But where our hearts truly
lie is in peace and quiet, and

9
00:00:46,100 --> 00:00:51,860
good till the birth. For all hobbits
share a love for things that grow.

10
00:00:56,160 --> 00:00:59,880
And yes, no doubt to others,
our ways seem quaint.

11
00:01:00,740 --> 00:01:05,950
But today of all days,
it is brought home to me,

12
00:01:06,000 --> 00:01:12,000
it is no bad thing to
celebrate a simple life.
